<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>AImageLab, University of Modena and Reggio Emilia, Italy
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
