<p id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">German Traffic Sign Recognition Benchmark (GTSRB)</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">41</a>]</cite>: The GTSRB dataset is licensed under the Creative Commons Zero (CC0) Public Domain Dedication.</p>
