<div id="A4.I1.i11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i11.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Multi-Genre Natural Language Inference (MNLI)</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a>]</cite>: The MNLI dataset is released under the Open American National Corpus (OANC) license, which permits free use, modification, and sharing under permissive terms.</p>
