<p id="A4.I1.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i12.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sentences Involving Compositional Knowledge (SICK)</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>]</cite>: The SICK dataset is distributed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike license.</p>
